# Ids and constants stay current

When a content id or display name changes, rename the matching C# constant in the same change. Do not leave leftover aliases (`LightBot` pointing at `ground-unit-attack`).

Convention: PascalCase constant = last kebab-case segment of the namespaced id. Roman suffixes stay `I`/`II` (`production-i` → `ProductionI`).

```csharp
// BAD — stale constant, live id
public static readonly TechnologyId LightBot = new("technology.t1.ground-unit-attack");

// GOOD — name matches the id
public static readonly TechnologyId GroundUnitAttack = new("technology.t1.ground-unit-attack");
```

Research also needs `config/research.json` and `ResearchDisplayNames` updated together.

`EntityKind.LightBot` / `Scout` are unit kinds, not research ids. T1 `AdditionalBastion` vs T2 `AdditionalBastions` is intentional (singular vs plural id).
